# Battle against Zamazenta (the hero of the shield, a wolf armoured like a wall): hammered open fifths, then the
# heroes' knightly fanfare, the same dotted leap up a fourth, held up by a brass wall in C minor over marcato strings
# and a steady drum line. Original composition for this game.
